        "If your pay stubs only reflect weekly overtime, you may be owed daily OT, double time, seventh-day premiums, and break penalties. Estimate the total with the [back-pay calculator](/calculators/back-pay-calculator), and review your options through the [California Labor Commissioner](/wage-claim/california) or the [DOL Wage and Hour Division](https://www.dol.gov/agencies/whd). This is general information, not legal advice."
