        "This protects workers from employers shopping for the cheapest labor laws. A company can't headquarter in a state with the federal $7.25 minimum and pay that to its remote workers in a $17 state. Confirm your local rate with the [minimum wage calculator](/calculators/minimum-wage-calculator)."
