        "She ran her numbers through the [tipped wage calculator](/calculators/tipped-wage-calculator) to confirm the tip-credit shortfall, then filed a complaint with the [DOL Wage and Hour Division](https://www.dol.gov/agencies/whd), which investigates tip-pool violations directly and can order back wages without the worker having to go to court."
